  "uuid": "e3455d33-0f03-42c0-9a79-7db5e0efa889",
  "name": "Add-on board for Raspberry Pi Pico",
  "description": "A 21 mm wide board that a Raspberry Pi Pico or Pico 2 plugs into, or that plugs onto one, with the two 1 x 20 sockets on the bottom matching the Pico pins and the four M2 holes on the Pico's pattern. The USB end is at the top; the height grows away from it. The corners are square, since the Pico's corner radius is not dimensioned. Raspberry Pi is a trademark of Raspberry Pi Ltd.",
  "category": "Raspberry Pi",
